{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Defence is an idle-farming simulator with defence content. This game is designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while your farm is woking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/52644f30632509f1b93cc7e159f893d9.avif?t=1761300013\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Grow Crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, use your drone to automatically grow crops. Better crops will cost some money to seed, but will give more fuel to activate your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Produce Fuel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use crops to produce fuel to run your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/5c5c00c6db536d5a534f6863df057c5c.avif?t=1761300013\" width=1560 height=556 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Defend your Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will run to your town hall repetitively. Place turrets to defend your town hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don`t worry. There is no game over in this game. When your town hall is broken, all zombies will disappear and you can try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/81682b8de3614764efcfc9a20d3facc0.avif?t=1761300013\" width=1560 height=940 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"OH! It`s Zombies!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/2b080b1e92f54579a59f248c52514287d6d68d21.jpg"},{"name":"These are weak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/e164cc86d192582ccd2b96da210c6c9bef42caf4.jpg"},{"name":"Not that fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/8a196f6a96ea60d1bf5cb3c15d5a529cfa916f29.jpg"},{"name":"Behind the line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/514a8c474953a9025eb1daf1eaad09bf27eb05cd.jpg"},{"name":"HEAVY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/148db1ea12bcab5bd8a3c52e916b8bc3b85ae5ad.jpg"},{"name":"I`m getting used to this","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/c6e8c74654be24dc26875cf052810b728c05445c.jpg"},{"name":"This is my new daily life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/d81c1d2a920b000a1ca34314ab2248e9065c2d4d.jpg"},{"name":"Some money in my pocket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/dbe96ce23d3343a47e55d54c1d3103dd358d087a.jpg"},{"name":"My pockets are getting heavy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/0c1e7d6e02ad802e13d3e3bb83b7a545ff133532.jpg"},{"name":"Millionair!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853400/6e6e64c5496611b447d5d736ed85aea5a4eccdd2.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853400?t=1761300013","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853400?t=1761300013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/dc1bdb6d4b84624ebeac145d8335e63551a1398a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761300013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/dc1bdb6d4b84624ebeac145d8335e63551a1398a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761300013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","